{"step_index":689,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T00:25:21Z","thinking":"**Analyzing the Bug**\n\nI've pinpointed the scrollbar issue! It seems that even with `overflow: hidden;` on the `body`, the scrollbar emerged on `.main-content`. The culprit? The `overflow-y: auto;` on `.main-content` coupled with the flex layout and 100vh height of `.app-layout`. This allowed `.main-content` to occupy remaining space, but internal content then caused the scrollbar.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\kakak\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\916274de-7f92-49fc-a0a8-d291664b474a\\\\.system_generated\\\\tasks\\\\task-687.log\"","toolAction":"\"Read log\"","toolSummary":"\"Read log\""}}]}
